{"id": 8794, "doi": "10.4038/slja.v31i1.8794", "title": "Anaphylactic Reaction to Cryoprecipitate in a Patient with Von Willebrand Disease During Factor Correction for Elective Cesarean Section", "abstract": "<p>A 40-year-old patient with Type I Von Willebrand Disease presented for elective cesarean section. At the operating theater before delivery, while receiving cryoprecipitate, she developed an anaphylactic reaction requiring resuscitation. Once she was hemodynamically stable, factor VIII/VWF concentrates were administered and operative delivery performed, with a good maternal and fetal outcome.</p>", "keywords": ["Von Willebrand disease", "Cesarean section", "Cryoprecipitate", "Anaphylactic reaction", "B-Lynch suture"], "authors": [{"first_name": "Samanka", "last_name": "Bandara", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "samanka4@gmail.com", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2159-6977"}, {"first_name": "Maduka", "last_name": "Imali", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Madura", "last_name": "Wanasinghe", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Chathura", "last_name": "Ratnayake", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Vasanthi", "last_name": "Pinto", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Padmalal", "last_name": "Desilva", "institution": "University of Peradeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}], "section": "Case Reports", "pages": "81-83", "date_published": "2023-05-02T00:00:00+00:00", "date_submitted": "2021-02-27T07:55:22+00:00", "license_name": "CC Attribution 4.0", "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "files": [{"label": "PDF", "language": "en", "url": "https://slja.sljol.info/articles/8794/files/8794-1-37933-8-10-20230428.pdf"}], "